stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Prepared: profile prepares assets
  Prepared --> Connecting: connect to game host
  Connecting --> Active: lobby handshake succeeds
  Connecting --> Recovering: connection fails
  Recovering --> Connecting: retry with backoff
  Active --> Transferring: level request observed
  Transferring --> Active: game confirms level and state
  Transferring --> Recovering: timeout or transport error
  Active --> Retiring: shutdown or ownership lost
  Recovering --> Retiring: retry exhausted or shutdown
  Retiring --> [*]: stop session and release resources
